  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Adm 207.06 Ex Parte Communications. Parties, intervenors and representatives shall not engage in ex parte communications prohibited by RSA 541-A: 36.\n\nSource. #2235, eff 12-30-82; ss by #3032, eff 5-31-85, EXPIRED: 5-31-91\n\nNew. #7102, eff 9-23-99; ss by #8908, eff 9-22-07",
